{"unit_id":"vitas__dsh-model-pricing#feature-1","repo":"vitas/dsh-model-pricing","commit":"1a22a334af2e2941f7a1378413a47a40df20eed4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-pricing 的功能「模型价格与能力表」：在 DSH 设置的 Models 页面展示可计价模型的单价、上下文长度和能力标签。进入设置页即可查看，并可按价格、标签和供应商信息浏览。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/PricingTable.tsx:173","src/host/catalog.js:27"]}
{"unit_id":"vitas__dsh-model-pricing#feature-2","repo":"vitas/dsh-model-pricing","commit":"1a22a334af2e2941f7a1378413a47a40df20eed4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-pricing 的功能「同模型跨供应商比较」：将规范化后的模型标识分组，标出较低报价及价格差异，供用户比较不同接入路线。表格加载后自动显示比较信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/catalog.js:129"]}
{"unit_id":"vitas__dsh-model-pricing#feature-3","repo":"vitas/dsh-model-pricing","commit":"1a22a334af2e2941f7a1378413a47a40df20eed4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-pricing 的功能「本地会话成本」：读取 DSH 保存的压缩会话记录，按实际调用的模型路线汇总 token 和估算费用，并呈现项目花费、缓存相关费用及路线表现。目录载入后自动生成汇总，不上传会话日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/sessions.js:86","src/host/sessions.js:290"]}
{"unit_id":"vitas__dsh-model-pricing#feature-4","repo":"vitas/dsh-model-pricing","commit":"1a22a334af2e2941f7a1378413a47a40df20eed4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-pricing 的功能「模型能力标签」：根据目录中的调用工具、推理、图像输入、上下文长度和开放权重等字段生成标签，并允许在设置中扩展或替换规则。用户可在表格中筛选标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/shared/tags.mjs:14","src/client/PricingTable.tsx:173"]}
{"unit_id":"vitas__dsh-model-pricing#feature-5","repo":"vitas/dsh-model-pricing","commit":"1a22a334af2e2941f7a1378413a47a40df20eed4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-pricing 的功能「社区促销」：读取静态促销信息源，为匹配的供应商或模型显示有效优惠及来源信息，并可筛选带优惠的条目。促销数据不可用时价格目录仍可正常使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/catalog.js:251","src/client/PricingTable.tsx:127"]}
